properties.label:
{[if IsGeauxAppTF]}
Select the owner of the home - if this is a home that was inherited or owned prior to marriage, select the person who inherited or owned it; otherwise, for a home acquired during your marriage, select the "jointly" option.
{[else]}
Select the one owner of the property to be donated, transfered, or sold. If separate property select one person, otherwise if community property select {[Client.NameCO]} and {[Spouse.NameCO]}.
{[endif]}

